2026-09-08  Oddur Sigurdsson  <oddurs@gmail.com>

	Initial import.

	* doc/DESIGN: New file; the concept, and the reasoning behind it.
	* crates/crabbucket: New crate; configuration, typed content
	collections, Markdown rendering, base-path-aware URLs, the Theme
	seam, and the build pipeline.
	* crates/crabbucket-ui: New crate; the default design system.
	build.rs generates Rust constants and CSS custom properties from
	design/tokens.toml.
	* crates/crabbucket-cli: New crate; the `crab' executable.
	* examples/site: New site; crabbucket's own, built with crabbucket.
	* design/tokens.toml: New file; the token source of truth.
	* turborust.toml: New file; the dev loop.
	* .github/workflows/ci.yml, .github/workflows/pages.yml: New files.
	* Cargo.toml, Makefile, .gitignore, rustfmt.toml: New files.
	* README, NEWS, AUTHORS, THANKS, HACKING, COPYING: New files.
